          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "henohu Yehova hakuhosha namwana kaAmozi Isaya, nindi, Yaku wakasubuli chikeleyi mumbunda yeyi, wakavúuli nawa masapatu kunyendu yeyi. Yena hakwilamu, hakwenda nzekesi nikunyendu kwamukunkulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Chanendiyi kambuŋami Isaya nzekesi nikunyendu kwamukunkulu nyaka yisatu, kulonda chinjikijilu nichihayamisha chawaEjipitu nawaEtiyopiya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dichi chakatwalawu aEjipitu muwukoli kudi mwanta wakuAshuri, dichi nawa chakayitundulawu niaEtiyopiya, niatwansi niakulumpi akekala nzekesi nikunyendu kwamukunkulu, nikumahanda kwakadi kubuta, kulonda aEjipitu atiyi nsonyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akakwata chikasa kukanwa, akatiya nsonyi nansaŋu yawaEtiyopiya akuhweleleluwu, niyawaEjipitu adiŋi lubanjilwawu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.5",
